  "notable_quotes": [
    "Interpenetration in pillar-layer frameworks, especially with large carboxylates, reduces accessible void space and is undesirable for applications.",
    "The pillar-exchange process provides a facile route to isoreticular MOFs with tunable flexibility and interpenetration via pillar type and size selection.",
